---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Journal — Devina Azaria" description="Curated learning notes, current essays, and selected historical writing from Devina Azaria's portfolio archive.">
<section class="shell section page-intro">
  <div class="eyebrow">Journal</div>
  <h1>Learning in public, over time.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Current essays sit alongside selected historical writing and learning notes from the earlier version of devina.id. Older material is curated carefully so that useful history remains visible without turning generic editorial content into personal achievements.</p>
</section>

<section class="shell section">
  <div class="grid journal-grid">
    <article class="card feature-card">
      <div class="tag">Technology & Society · New</div>
      <h2>AI Tidak Boleh Berlari Lebih Cepat daripada Kemampuan Manusia Mengendalikannya</h2>
      <p class="muted">Tentang AI capability, governance capacity, dan gagasan Governance Debt: kemampuan sistem tidak seharusnya melampaui kemampuan manusia untuk memahami, mengendalikan, mengaudit, dan mengamankannya.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/journal/ai-governance-debt/">Read Essay →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="tag">Learning Journey</div>
      <h3>Coding Journey</h3>
      <p class="muted">A curated timeline of coding and technology learning discovered in the legacy archive, beginning with early coding-interest articles and later learning-roadmap material.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/journal/coding-journey/">Open Coding Journey →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="tag">Technology</div>
      <h3>AI & Digital Literacy</h3>
      <p class="muted">Selected legacy writing on AI, digital services, privacy, and responsible technology use, preserved as historical learning context with explicit provenance boundaries.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/journal/technology-literacy/">Open Technology Archive →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="tag">Culture & Creative</div>
      <h3>Culture, Music & Communication</h3>
      <p class="muted">A curated bridge between historical culture-related writing and the stronger evidence found in Devina's performances, recordings, and verified achievement records.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/journal/culture-communication/">Open Culture Archive →</a>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="shell section archive-note">
  <div class="eyebrow">Migration Note</div>
  <h2>Curated, not copied wholesale.</h2>
  <p class="lead">The previous WordPress site mixed personal learning content with SEO, commerce, recipes, catalog material, and other experiments. The new journal keeps useful history without presenting every legacy post as a personal achievement or original work.</p>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
